    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate species range sizes, occupancy, local richness, dominance and fossil first occurrences from georeferenced living and fossil records, with standardized sampling and taxonomic validation. The claim predicts unusually broad ranges, high local richness, weak dominance and long genus or family durations.";
